  provenanceNote: 'Raw-to-canonical rotation is AUTHORED: it is copied from the Owner-authored
    fit on Assets/GalaQuest/Gear/Definitions/Gear_SilverguardHelmet.asset, which
    is the human statement of how this source art is oriented. Everything after that
    point is MEASURED from the mesh and DERIVED by division. This registration does
    not modify the Owner-authored fit. Raw canonical size (1.0000, 0.9277, 0.7949)
    m; after the single uniform scale 0.34860 it is (0.3486, 0.3234, 0.2771) m. The
    Owner-authored uniform scale for this item is 0.40929, so the contract sizes
    it 85.2 % of the hand fit. The contract normalizes helmet OUTER width to the
    head CAVITY width, which omits shell thickness, so it is expected to run smaller
    than a hand fit.'
